<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Home on uli's blog</title><link>/</link><description>Recent content in Home on uli's blog</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 13 Jul 2025 11:52:17 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>真正搞懂机器数（下）</title><link>/posts/%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E6%90%9E%E6%87%82%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%8B/</link><pubDate>Sun, 13 Jul 2025 10:15:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>/posts/%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E6%90%9E%E6%87%82%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%8B/</guid><description>上次我们讨论了机器定点数的表示，这次来搞懂浮点数。</description></item><item><title>真正搞懂机器数(上)</title><link>/posts/%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E6%90%9E%E6%87%82%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%8A/</link><pubDate>Sat, 12 Jul 2025 16:29:31 +0800</pubDate><guid>/posts/%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E6%90%9E%E6%87%82%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%8A/</guid><description>原码，补码，反码，移码——作为计组重要且基础的内容，贯穿在整个计算机的学习过程中。然而，在学习的过程中，我们很少弄懂“为什么”，而是只学会了计算方法。是时候真正搞懂机器数了。</description></item><item><title>最后一次学 KMP</title><link>/posts/%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E5%AD%A6-kmp/</link><pubDate>Thu, 29 May 2025 21:22:04 +0800</pubDate><guid>/posts/%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E5%AD%A6-kmp/</guid><description>本文力争成为最后一篇 KMP 讲解</description></item><item><title>使用正念练习对抗自然惰性</title><link>/posts/%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%AD%A3%E5%BF%B5%E7%BB%83%E4%B9%A0%E5%AF%B9%E6%8A%97%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E6%83%B0%E6%80%A7/</link><pubDate>Tue, 25 Mar 2025 21:36:46 +0800</pubDate><guid>/posts/%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%AD%A3%E5%BF%B5%E7%BB%83%E4%B9%A0%E5%AF%B9%E6%8A%97%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E6%83%B0%E6%80%A7/</guid><description>我们往往过着昏迷般的清醒生活，因此我试图通过正念练习的技术来对抗我们的自然惰性。</description></item><item><title>使用frp搭建个人办公网络</title><link>/posts/%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8frp%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8A%9E%E5%85%AC%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C/</link><pubDate>Wed, 15 Jan 2025 23:37:49 +0800</pubDate><guid>/posts/%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8frp%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8A%9E%E5%85%AC%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C/</guid><description>假如你有一台云服务器，除了建站，还能够做什么有意思的事情？</description></item><item><title>计算机组成原理个人笔记</title><link>/posts/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/</link><pubDate>Wed, 15 Jan 2025 23:37:30 +0800</pubDate><guid>/posts/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/</guid><description>在这里记录下这些关键点和做题方法。</description></item><item><title>暑训之罚训大礼包</title><link>/posts/%E6%9A%91%E8%AE%AD%E4%B9%8B%E7%BD%9A%E8%AE%AD%E5%A4%A7%E7%A4%BC%E5%8C%85/</link><pubDate>Wed, 15 Jan 2025 23:37:09 +0800</pubDate><guid>/posts/%E6%9A%91%E8%AE%AD%E4%B9%8B%E7%BD%9A%E8%AE%AD%E5%A4%A7%E7%A4%BC%E5%8C%85/</guid><description>由于不可抗力的迟到，被赏了一套26道的罚训大礼包，写了三四天。</description></item><item><title>线段树及其扩展</title><link>/posts/%E7%BA%BF%E6%AE%B5%E6%A0%91%E5%8F%8A%E5%85%B6%E6%89%A9%E5%B1%95/</link><pubDate>Wed, 15 Jan 2025 23:36:37 +0800</pubDate><guid>/posts/%E7%BA%BF%E6%AE%B5%E6%A0%91%E5%8F%8A%E5%85%B6%E6%89%A9%E5%B1%95/</guid><description>线段树是一种维护区间性质，满足符合结合律的运算的区间修改的数据结构。</description></item><item><title>最短路算法总结</title><link>/posts/%E6%9C%80%E7%9F%AD%E8%B7%AF%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/</link><pubDate>Wed, 15 Jan 2025 23:36:18 +0800</pubDate><guid>/posts/%E6%9C%80%E7%9F%AD%E8%B7%AF%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/</guid><description>最短路应该是图论最基本的问题了，之后在各种问题中也会作为基本算法组合使用。</description></item><item><title>Codeforces 1753B</title><link>/posts/codeforces-1753b/</link><pubDate>Wed, 15 Jan 2025 23:35:47 +0800</pubDate><guid>/posts/codeforces-1753b/</guid><description>记一道题</description></item><item><title>Tarjan强连通分量与缩点</title><link>/posts/tarjan%E5%BC%BA%E8%BF%9E%E9%80%9A%E5%88%86%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%8E%E7%BC%A9%E7%82%B9/</link><pubDate>Wed, 15 Jan 2025 23:34:56 +0800</pubDate><guid>/posts/tarjan%E5%BC%BA%E8%BF%9E%E9%80%9A%E5%88%86%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%8E%E7%BC%A9%E7%82%B9